  "worked_solution": "In the model, we have $\\frac{1}{4}$ on the left.\n\nSince we need to divide by $4$, we split the whole into $4$ equal parts horizontally. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14133144/assets/a34a3fb198ef2ea79f8baf8f0acbdbdc179c6259c614824315d3d96e5ea4e921.png)\n\nFrom the picture on the right, we obtain that the shaded part represents $\\frac{1}{16}$ of the whole.\n\nTherefore, the missing picture is the following:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14133144/assets/1c57b2431287f9077c24e5e256c57220263aff5d475336dafe26c75a8e30bd62.png)",
